Restricted (step-weight) MIDAS-VAR: unemployment-gap response (pp) per +1 pp event-day rise in the scaling variable (2-year for NS/NS-GB, funds rate for MP1); median [90% interval] over 200 draws
MODEL = daily block dynamics after the event day; PATH = direct event-day path through the end of month t+1, then the model. BASE = lagged monthly averages; +CUR = current-month average added (robustness)

